<title>USA: Johnston CSD, Iowa, won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Johnston CSD, Iowa, won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc. said it won $3.750 million of Johnston CSD, Iowa, general obligation school bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.49 percent.</p>
